## Engine tests (patched tree)

```
$ bun test packages/engine/test/git.test.ts packages/engine/test/git-machine.test.ts packages/engine/test/connectors.test.ts

packages\engine\test\git.test.ts:
(pass) git proxy > clone: our credential in, GitHub's token added only upstream, audited
(pass) git proxy > GitLab clone: the instance's URL and its git sign-in go upstream, GitHub is never called
(pass) git proxy > GitLab push: the instance's merge base proves the fast-forward, then receive-pack goes there
(pass) GitLab push: a merge base that is not the old tip refuses the push, and nothing is sent
... existing GitHub, branch-approval and App tests ...

packages\engine\test\git-machine.test.ts:
(pass) git on a connected machine through the proxy (ADR 0024 addendum) > a GitLab-only workspace: the credential is ours, git.sync points at its connection, git_clone is the one tool
... existing machine tests ...

packages\engine\test\connectors.test.ts:
(pass) connections > a self-hosted GitLab connection keeps its base URL and token server side
... existing connector tests ...

 62 pass
