## Pre-existing failure, not caused by this series

`bun test apps/server/test/connectors.test.ts` fails 1 of 11 on Windows, on the pinned tree **before**
the patches and after them, with the same assertion:

```
$ bun test apps/server/test/connectors.test.ts
...
  [
    "github",
-   true,
+   false,
  ]
      at apps/server/test/connectors.test.ts:349:82
(fail) catalog: one list of our connectors and the one-click MCP servers, one entry per service, brand icons
 10 pass
 1 fail
```

The test builds the web app's public directory with `new URL("../../web/public", import.meta.url).pathname`,
which on win32 is `/C:/...`; `existsSync` then fails for every icon. The file is not touched by this
series and the failure is the same on the pristine pin. On Linux CI the path is valid.

